Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:07.45,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.79,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Saki-san. Yuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:15.12,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,If you're waiting for Misae, she'll be absent today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:17.79,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,She called Saki this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:21.01,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,She said she caught a cold and so she'll be absent from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.55,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:25.88,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,So something did happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:29.10,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,It's unreal that Misae would skip school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:32.18,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Could it be that Igarashi-kun told her... this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:36.48,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,I see. So she got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.65,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Poor Misae.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:40.44,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,But hey, Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:47.45,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,I think a boy like you is a better match for Misae than Igarashi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:49.83,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Comfort Misae for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:52.54,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,I'll call her out to the park later.
