Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:49.40,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Sagara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:53.82,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sh-Shima-kun. Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:57.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Um, Sagara-sa... I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:02:59.29,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Misae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:00.96,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:05.29,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Love is like a firework from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:06.67,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:11.09,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's more beautiful for it to go to pieces and scatter far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:13.55,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Are you picking a fight with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:13.97,Default-alt,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:19.27,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.60,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:24.31,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Then in case you don't find paper in the bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:27.77,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Are you being considerate or inconsiderate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.49,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're speaking complete nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:34.66,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I bet Yuki and Saki told you to say all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.28,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:40.33,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You would never say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:43.42,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why don't you say something original?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.54,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:51.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:54.43,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:59.68,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Probably... because I feel I'm responsible for the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:03.69,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? You have nothing to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:08.44,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Thinking back, I think there's a ton of stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.32,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:15.95,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,But really, the reason I'm depressed is because of something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.03,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:19.83,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:24.67,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Are you thinking this is your chance to have me fall for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:27.79,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Like I said it would be, yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:31.17,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I wasn't thinking of something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:42.89,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Of course. You only came to return a favor;\Nit's not like you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:44.43,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:50.11,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:54.32,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,So, you do like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:56.66,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:00.53,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I... see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:10.09,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,So hey. What do you like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:16.22,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Things like you yelling at me and worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:21.60,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Also, whenever you put me in a wrestling hold,\NI can smell your good scent...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.89,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,...and I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.23,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I don't think that last one was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:26.94,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.60,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Forget about apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:31.82,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:34.82,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:37.07,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:41.83,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Um... You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:45.79,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Misae!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.12,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Do you have time today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:53.46,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,There's a new ice cream shop\Non the other side of the station!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:56.13,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sorry. Today's... See?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:06:01.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,He's waiting and all, so I'd feel bad if I didn't go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.05,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:06.06,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,I guess things are going well for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:08.02,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,She looks so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:10.27,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Student Council President?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:15.90,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yup. Believe it or not, I'm the school's first female Student Council President.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:18.03,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Wow, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:20.41,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,The Autumn Festival is coming up soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:26.54,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Our school's helping out with it, too, so things are a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.12,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Autumn Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:28.87,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.75,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,...if you don't have any plans on that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:34.25,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,...would you want to go with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:35.63,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,To the Autumn Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:42.14,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'll be discovered... I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:44.60,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:48.85,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I see. So Misae-san's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:51.52,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Yes. She's attending a Student Council meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:54.44,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,She wanted us to tell you that she'll be out late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:59.57,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I want to see her working.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:09.87,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Actually, he looks so cute it's starting to make me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:17.46,Default-alt,Yos,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll deliver this love quietly to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.46,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,That's Yoshino-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:21.17,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,He's as popular as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:24.47,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey you. Which class are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.89,0:07:27.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you around. Are you a transfer student?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:30.56,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Want me to give you a tour of the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:34.10,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,That's fine. We're taking her around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.77,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.40,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,No need to be modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to flirt with her or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:41.86,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,We're really fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:43.11,Default-alt,Girls,0,0,0,,Go on, Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:43.86,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Then at least tell me her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:44.99,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,No, it's really all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:46.58,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey, wait you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:47.74,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I said wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:53.79,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Moving on to the next topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:58.13,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Regarding the student who brings in guitars and has live concerts in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:08:03.26,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,There's no problem with singing, but it shouldn't be done in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.59,Default-alt,Shi,0,0,0,,She's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:05.80,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Do you need something in the Student Council room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:10.18,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,If you need something inside, go on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:13.31,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,It's not as though it is off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:15.06,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,No, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:15.90,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.15,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Sagara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:18.32,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Ibuki-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:21.61,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you in the middle of your meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:23.70,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,It seems she has something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:25.28,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:29.95,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Wow, she's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:31.87,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I didn't know we had a girl like this at our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:35.12,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.54,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You have something you want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:40.05,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Say what's on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.05,0:08:43.67,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's the Student Council's job to listen to the students' opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:46.26,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.76,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:54.94,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I want you to be with me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:09:01.19,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Um... What relationship do the two of you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.53,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fry-4\frz7.276\blur0.3\fax-0.1\b1\fs45\fnArial Black\move(981,568.5,981,616.5,0,1482)\c&H313742&\clip(586.67,337.34,1385.33,797.34)}Girls' Locker Room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:14.37,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,That was hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's not a laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.29,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Maybe she figured out that it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:21.46,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:24.97,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Misae might like you more in that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:27.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,How could that be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:31.43,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:34.47,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I had forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.19,0:09:39.60,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Hey, Shima-kun. Are you busy after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:46.24,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,We were just saying that we should go visit your place after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:53.41,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Oh, so Misae hasn't been to your place yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:58.00,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,This sense of superiority from visiting the home before the girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:10:00.58,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Let's brag to Misae later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:07.51,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.38,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,You don't feel like it after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.51,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.97,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I can't remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:18.48,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,...where my home is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.23,0:10:21.98,Signs,Girls,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fnEdo SZ\fs108\an5\c&H00030D&\pos(811.5,552)}Shima
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:23.98,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Hey, it's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:27.19,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Don't scare us with a joke like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:32.66,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.20,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:37.70,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Say, "I'm home."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.71,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Are you Katsuki's friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:43.59,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:47.09,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:51.84,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Please come in and offer incense for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:58.35,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.06,0:11:00.23,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I remember now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:04.86,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,The real Shima Katsuki is no longer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:10.36,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm not actually Shima Katsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:13.03,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:13.53,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:27.09,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:30.38,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,There's a story behind this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.01,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Is there anything we can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:38.43,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Then at least remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:42.77,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,We believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:46.98,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Because to us, you are Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:50.36,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, we are your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:52.40,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.70,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,We'll keep this from Misae.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:12:00.29,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,If there's something you have to tell her,\Nmake sure you let her know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:00.79,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.75,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I finally remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.92,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm not Shima Katsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:17.80,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That was the name of the person dearest to me. {ep 5}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:29.90,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We spent much time together,\Nand he left me with his last wish. {ep 5}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:35.61,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I came to grant that wish. {ep 5}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.54,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.92,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:51.38,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's fine, since I'm always the one making you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.93,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,The girl from yesterday was you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:12:59.72,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,So you knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:03.27,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Of course. We see each other every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:06.48,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Was I a bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:10.32,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's fine. I bet it was Yuki and Saki who made you do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:14.99,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:19.07,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Yes. Since that's why I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:23.75,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,See? There's a light that grants a wish in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.41,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,What? It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:29.88,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Maybe there was nothing there to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:34.51,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If not, it means that it's not necessary for me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:40.26,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What's important is for us to be happy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:43.43,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But this is important, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:45.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Even if you say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:47.06,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:48.52,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You have a wish in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.48,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:55.78,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,So here's the wish you so wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:13:59.91,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:04.41,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,...love me forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:11.96,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Please continue to love me forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:15.17,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,That's what I wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.77,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sorry. Did I surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:38.95,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Looks like I really did love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:45.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Though it was only for a short period of time, the time we spent together was precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:49.25,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I liked Yuki-san and Saki-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:54.21,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I loved the time we spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:58.55,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be a copy of what you said to me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:04.18,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Gosh, why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:05.39,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're really one of those people who can't be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:10.39,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Misae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:12.90,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:17.40,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:24.87,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I-I'll go buy something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:26.41,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:51.77,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Shima-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:55.10,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Shima-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:15:57.98,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Shima-ku-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:02.32,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.28,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.79,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Shima-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:17.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Farewell, Misae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:22.63,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I will continue to love you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.93,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:36.56,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:41.69,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yeah, the boy's dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:46.91,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,No plans for anything like that at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:52.45,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's not that I can't forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:56.87,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I guess that's how my life works.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:02.09,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's all meet up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.88,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,With Yuki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:04.55,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.35,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You decided to make this your home, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:15.44,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You like being with me that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:19.98,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I don't particularly like cats, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:29.87,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,That was stupid. Why am I thinking of a fairytale-like thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:33.87,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're a really strange cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:38.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:40.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:46.01,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You had a good nap there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.51,0:17:48.97,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You looked like my cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:51.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's getting late, so let's make our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:53.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.14,0:17:58.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sorry we stayed for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.73,0:17:59.90,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:03.02,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Make sure you have him take you to the Autumn Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:03.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:05.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you show me that dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:11.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you do have a name after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:15.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So there are things you want me to tell her, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:28.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.09,0:18:32.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You've had something on your mind since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:36.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've been thinking about how to let\NMisae-san know about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:44.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's Misae-san's kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:49.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Is there something you still want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.57,0:18:52.78,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.08,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,And her boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Misae-san. Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:58.25,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you caught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:18:59.50,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Man, I'm out of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:02.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Could you fix the way you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:06.42,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Did you come to the festival with your cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:13.01,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,No. He suddenly dashed out and I came chasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:16.26,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I have no idea what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:22.27,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Gosh. I really have to keep my eyes on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:27.44,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Hey, come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:34.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think he's wanted to come to this festival with you for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:31.49,Default-alt,Mis,0,0,0,,We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:40.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Last night, I think I heard his voice in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:47.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He said, "I'm sorry I couldn't be with you until the end of the festival."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:50.84,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.43,0:19:54.64,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Did he say anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:59.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And, "As you wished, I'll always be with you."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:09.61,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I don't remember saying I would go on a date with a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:14.45,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,But I guess I'll play with you a lot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:19.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There's one more thing to tell you, Misae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:24.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He wishes for you to find your happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:29.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After all, he's like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:32.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:38.89,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. He is like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:40.22,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:46.40,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll try and enjoy another youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:51.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:56.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll tell you about the dream I had last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:21:00.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A wondrous love story from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:13.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:15.42,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:22.60,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,My current master is not the same as you,\Nbut she's a very kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:28.48,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But she makes me worry at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:33.03,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Was I able to meet the goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:38.70,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Was I able to fulfill the promise we made?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.49,0:21:44.58,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Now, it's been too long, and I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:49.71,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But right now, I want to remain like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:54.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Please allow me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:22:05.64,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Please allow me to be with her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:41.34,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:41.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:48.43,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:48.43,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:55.73,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:55.73,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small silhouette leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.56,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.56,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
