Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:45.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.28,0:23:48.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Miyazawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He just wants to act bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.96,0:23:56.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He'll be as snotty as possible to anyone who's weaker than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 7
